<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24160" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρρις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (
			Att.
		 form of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Δέρσις,</span> cf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>skin,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τριχίνη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Za.</u>
					13.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				12.33
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leathern covering,</i> of a jerkin, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				328
			</span></i>; of a curtain, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				240
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Myrtil.
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> in pl.
			(sg., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				95.34
			</span></i>), <i>screens of skin</i> or <i>hide,</i> hung before
			fortifications to deaden the enemy's missiles, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				4.19.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				142.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				3.11.13
			</span></i>: generally, <i>curtain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				26.7
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.35
			</span></i> (Andania, <span class="entity">i B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
